# BELT AND BRACES. Every subdirectory here carries its own .gitignore naming its
# own harness binaries; this one repeats the CLASSES that must never enter the
# diff regardless of what a future subdirectory is called. This branch has been
# caught twice -- once with 13 BATCHLAS_KERNEL_TRACE JSON dumps that were 83% of
# the PR diff.
*.nsys-rep
*.sqlite
*.qdstrm
*.qdrep
nsys/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.o
*.so
